{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47027","headline":"昇天行 · 齐己","name":"昇天行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身不沉，骨不重，驱青鸾，驾白凤。\n幢盖飘摇入冷空，天风瑟瑟星河动。\n瑶阙参差阿母家，楼台戏闭凝彤霞。\n三五仙子乘龙车，堂前碾烂蟠桃花。\n回头却顾蓬莱顶，一点浓岚在深井。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47027.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47027","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}